WEBVTT

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:06.330
What is this...?

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:10.040
I get the feelin' I'm bein' watched...

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:12.610
Are you sure it's not

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:13.980
Just because I'm looking at

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.040
You from over here?

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:20.170
Nah, it's different... Like, there's 
this kinda weird tension...

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:24.170
But I guess it could just be
the president spyin' on us again...

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:32.500
Kotoba harari

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:35.630
Kimochi fuwari

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:40.540
Noseru omoitachi

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:47.130
Koi ni somatteku

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:53.330
Kimi to itara ame no naka 
mo chigatta shizuku ni naru

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:56.540
Donna moji o tsuzuttara

00:00:56.540 --> 00:00:59.710
Iroasezuni nokoru no deshou?

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:01.250
Shitterun da

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:07.210
Ima no futari wa tooi ano hi ni naru koto

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.630
Sou desho kamisama

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.130
Marumaru mizu mo konai densha mo

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:18.710
Motto kono shunkan ga

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:23.710
Douka eien ni tsuzuite

00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:25.750
Nante muri ka na?

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:34.000
Poem 4:   The Canvas Girl

00:01:35.330 --> 00:01:39.000
It's been five days, and
I still feel like I'm bein' watched...

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:41.580
Huh? Sounds like you have a stalker.

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:43.250
A stalker?

00:01:43.710 --> 00:01:45.960
When exactly do you feel 
like you're being watched?

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.710
It happens randomly when
I'm doin' normal, everyday stuff.

00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:53.420
Like, when I'm on my way to school.

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:55.000
Uh-huh...

00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:59.290
Or like, when I'm dukin' 
it out with a stray dog.

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:03.680
I'm suddenly very concerned
about your definition of "normal"!

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:05.950
You think it could be

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:07.140
A ghost or spirit who's just

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:08.160
Looking out for you?

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:10.710
A spirit, eh? In that case...

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:13.540
HEY, GHOST!

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:16.400
Quit slinkin' around and 
lemme see your ugly mug!

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:18.150
Whaddya think of this?!

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:20.660
You ain't gonna sneak up on me!

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:27.670
Oh, maybe it's a girl who wants 
to ask you out, Eiji-kun!

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:31.960
Huh?

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:35.540
What would you do if she was super cute?

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:44.040
You're totally grinning.

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:48.460
I am a MAN!

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:50.390
I ain't so soft that I'd start grinnin'

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:53.440
like an idiot because of 
some girl, you got that?!

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:57.170
Even if she's your type?
With fair skin and long, black hair?

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:02.040
That's what I thought!

00:03:02.650 --> 00:03:03.710
What WOULD you do if

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:04.940
A girl confessed her feelings

00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:05.920
And then asked you out?

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:07.750
Guh! Why would-?!

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:10.750
If it just came outta nowhere like that,
obviously I'd turn her down!

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:14.050
Okay then, what if

00:03:14.050 --> 00:03:14.910
I was the one-

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:24.550
Hey! Wait, Nanako!

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:31.420
Ooh, let's see here...

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.710
Aren't you takin' this 
a little too seriously?

00:03:47.130 --> 00:03:48.310
I'm on full alert!

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:49.860
I won't miss a single thing!

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:50.880
Nothing gets past me!

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:53.420
Good ol' Nanako!

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.920
I'm countin' on you to get me
to the next convenience store.

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:07.710
Don't worry one bit!

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:08.900
There's nothing unusual.

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:10.060
It's totally safe!

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:11.960
Oh yeah? Thanks.

00:04:15.670 --> 00:04:18.180
She's failed to notice 
that we've already passed

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:19.480
about seven convenience stores...

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:21.290
I'll just leave her be.

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:23.250
Hm?

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:26.320
I found you!

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:29.130
Hey, you bastard! The hell is your prob-?!

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:35.790
A drawing?! Who the hell are you?!

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:42.700
Oh, are you perhaps

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:44.020
The infamous "stalker" I've

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:45.330
Been hearing about?

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:50.170
Stop hiding and show us your face.

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:54.830
Don't try to weasel your 
way out of this like that!

00:04:58.420 --> 00:05:00.500
We finally get a good look at you.

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:02.380
Why have you been followin' me around?

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:11.380
Handbook

00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:09.380
Is that s'posed to be me?

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:11.000
My student handbook...?

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:14.500
I musta dropped it!

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:19.420
So, you picked it up thinkin' 
you'd give it back...

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:23.330
but I was too intimidating...

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:26.290
so you missed your chance to hand it over...

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:28.850
and all you could do was follow me around...

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.250
So that's what was going on...

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:38.290
My bad! I shouldn't have 
called you a stalker.

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:42.850
Thanks again!

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:46.280
You're welcome to come hang out
with us at the Literature Club sometime!

00:05:50.630 --> 00:05:53.250
Literature Club

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:53.250
Hey, Eiji-kun...

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:55.290
Do you wear your uniform at home, too?

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:56.670
Yup, sure do!

00:05:57.170 --> 00:05:59.380
You don't sleep in it, do you?

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:00.860
Don't be silly!

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:02.710
Of course I change out of it before bed!

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:05.170
I have a different uniform I use as pajamas.

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:06.670
That still counts!

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:12.470
Oh, glad you could make it!

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:15.710
Huh? This is the girl who was stalking you?

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:17.940
Turns out she's not a stalker.

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:20.040
She's so tiny and cute!

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:21.330
What's your name?

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:24.540
Hm? What's wrong?

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:27.950
Seems she has a hard time lettin'
her emotions show in front of other people.

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:30.040
Ah, gotcha...

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:35.960
*HOW IT ACTUALLY SOUNDS

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:40.370
Hello.
I'm Kino Yakobe.

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:45.130
Hello! My name is
Nanako Yukishiro.
It's nice to meet you!

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:50.050
I-is is alright
if I call you
"Nanako-chan"?

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:55.010
That's totally fine!
I hope that from now on we
Can become good friends!

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:01.040
They're clearly excited, but...

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:02.750
It's weirdly quiet...

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:08.630
That reminds me! What should 
we call you, Miss Stalker?

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:10.170
Is "Kino" alright?

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:14.790
Jeez, you've gone and embarrassed her.

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:15.880
OK!

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:18.170
...I honestly didn't think 
she'd be okay with it!

00:07:18.170 --> 00:07:19.710
Hey, you're pretty cool!

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:22.920
Kino-chan, you're really talented at drawing.

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:26.170
Well, I dunno about "talented," but
I've loved drawing for as long as I can remember.

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:28.460
When I was little, I'd get in trouble all the time
for stuff like coloring on the walls.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:30.750
To tell you the truth, there was even a time
when I aspired to be a manga artist.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:32.960
But now, I wouldn't mind any job
so long as it has to do with drawing.

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:34.830
At least, that's what I've been thinking,
but I'm still kinda unsure.

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:36.460
You talk more than I thought!

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:38.670
Got any other drawings you've done?

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:43.210
Whoa, these are really good too.

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:44.950
It seems like being

00:07:44.950 --> 00:07:46.260
Able to draw this well would

00:07:46.260 --> 00:07:47.250
Be a ton of fun!

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:48.790
Right?

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:53.380
Well then, why don't we take this opportunity
to have Kino-chan teach us?

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:54.880
How about it, Kino-cha...?

00:07:56.750 --> 00:08:00.290
Sorry, sorry! I guess you can't draw
your answer without your sketchboo-

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:01.130
OK!

00:08:01.130 --> 00:08:02.920
That's an impressive skill!

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:08.210
First, me and Nanako will draw the president,
and then we'll have Kino take a look.

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:11.220
Hold it! How come I get left out?

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:14.420
Because, President, you only know
how to draw naked stuff.

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:17.000
Don't make it sound like
I'm some kind of weirdo hentai artist!

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:18.730
I can draw normal things too, you know!

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:21.680
Okay, then try drawing all the 
snacks on top of that desk.

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:23.890
Creamy Baked
Egg Custard
Moriyama
Milk Chocolate

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:23.750
Way too easy!

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:27.130
Just do this... Then go like 
that... Add a little here...

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:27.710
Perfect!

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:30.330
You drew them all naked!

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:33.330
Yeah, President... How 'bout 
you just be our model?

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:35.960
Oh fine, I guess I've got no choice.

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:37.630
Make me look cute, 'kay?

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:38.540
Right!

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:40.020
Just leave it to me!

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:41.380
I'll draw you so super cute,

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:42.460
You won't believe it!

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:44.500
I'm counting on you, Nanako-chan!

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:47.100
The first thing you do

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:48.640
Is carefully observe your

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:49.960
Potential subject!

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.800
Whoa, so professional!

00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:00.150
Wait just a second...

00:09:00.150 --> 00:09:01.630
I don't actually know what

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:02.670
This pose is used for...

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:05.580
I had a feeling that was the case...

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:07.580
Finished!

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:13.000
Why do I look terrifying in your picture?!

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:15.650
Nanako's picture turned out really cute.

00:09:21.130 --> 00:09:23.170
Da-dum-dum-dum-dum-dum

00:09:21.130 --> 00:09:23.170
Now, let's see what Master Kino thinks...

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:24.580
Please wait while I tally your scores!

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:27.880
Scoring Currently in Progress!!

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:26.040
Wait, really?!

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:27.630
You're enjoying this too much!

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:31.000
Well, Master Kino? How would 
you rate their drawings?

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:34.920
You wanna see some more first?

00:10:02.210 --> 00:10:04.380
Don't cover your face up like that!

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:07.230
It's your fault, Ei-chan...

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:08.470
You keep staring right at me...

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:09.300
It's embarrassing...

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:12.380
But that's how this works.

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:14.140
Which makes me wonder...

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:16.760
How come you're able to draw me 
so easily without havin' to look?

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:23.420
Well, that's obvious.

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:24.870
It's because I get to see

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:26.130
Your face every day!

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:30.630
O-oh, well... I guess that makes sense...

00:10:42.460 --> 00:10:43.330
Done!

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:48.750
Is my face really that round?

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:53.960
Alrighty! Let's hear from 
our judge, Master Kino!

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:56.790
Da-dum-dum-dum-dum-dum

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:59.420
You both nailed it! 100 points!

00:10:56.880 --> 00:11:01.710
You both nailed it!
100 points!!

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:01.260
Isn't that a little generous?!

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:15.540
Waracchau kurai mattaku chigau watashitachi

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:20.920
Show window utsuru sugata sae

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:26.580
Taiyou mitai ni anata ga hohoemu to

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:35.130
Odayaka na kuuki ga nagareru

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:42.330
Arikitari na nichijou de sae mo

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:47.920
Anata to nara kagayakidasu

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:51.380
Tatoe nani ga okita toshitemo

00:11:51.380 --> 00:11:54.540
Tamani kizutsuki kizutsuketemo

00:11:54.540 --> 00:12:01.880
Nanigenai hi o shinjiteite

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:07.120
On the next epi-

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:08.590
-sode of Senryu Girl:

00:12:08.590 --> 00:12:09.670
"The Fortune Teller...

00:12:09.670 --> 00:12:10.630
...Girl!"

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:13.790
Next Time, Poem 5
"The Fortune Teller Girl"
